From 615e99bfba41072124d96c8d052094a805ae0078 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:14:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - trainer visits: trainer_list/buy/learn_all,
 known spells, rank-aware abilities

- interact: known spells from SMSG_INITIAL_SPELLS / LEARNED / REMOVED / SUPERCEDED
  (old, new); trainer_list (NPCPackets TrainerList layout), trainer_buy, trainer_learn_all
  (cheapest first, re-list per round), spells
- runner: class trainers from trainer (Type 0, Requirement = class) +
  creature_default_trainer; visits on start and every level-up; abilities = class list at
  the highest known rank (spell_ranks)
- verified: level 6 warrior at Frang learned 100, 772, 3127, 6343, 6552, 34428 (570c)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
